# Defense-in-depth alongside .gitignore: if Vercel ever deploys via direct
# upload (`vercel` CLI) instead of a Git-connected build, or if "Include files
# outside of the Root Directory" is enabled for this monorepo, these large
# local-only dataset/cache folders must not be uploaded either. They are not
# deleted - just excluded from what gets shipped to Vercel. The demo-site app
# only needs the small exported JSON weights under
# demo-site/src/lib/biometrics/model/, not any of this.
Keystrokes/
training_files/
test_files/
main_trainset/
Bogazici_cleaned/
encoder2/
encoder3/
artifacts/cache/
.cache_train.npz
*.parquet
